      "start_verse": 5,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 5,
      "title": "",
      "content": "work (c-15) A thing done, as Isa. 5.12."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 1,
      "start_verse": 8,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 8,
      "title": "",
      "content": "prance (d-20) Or 'spread themselves.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 1,
      "start_verse": 9,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 9,
      "title": "",
      "content": "crowd (e-9) Or 'the striving,' 'eagerness.' forwards, (f-14) Others 'eastwards.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 1,
      "start_verse": 11,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 11,
      "title": "",
      "content": "mind (g-4) Lit. 'spirit,' or 'state of soul.' guilty. (h-13) Or 'Then will he sweep by [as] the wind, and pass on and make himself guilty.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 1,
      "start_verse": 16,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 16,
      "title": "",
      "content": "dainty. (a-24) Or 'plenteous.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 2,
      "start_verse": 3,
      "end_chapter": 2,
      "end_verse": 3,
      "title": "",
      "content": "delay. (b-34) Or 'be behindhand.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 2,
      "start_verse": 5,
      "end_chapter": 2,
      "end_verse": 5,
      "title": "",
      "content": "man, (c-11) Geber. Job 3.3. desire (d-20) Or 'appetite;' lit. 'soul.' see Isa. 5.14."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 2,
      "start_verse": 6,
      "end_chapter": 2,
      "end_verse": 6,
      "title": "",
      "content": "pledges! (e-39) There is a play on the word, which may also mean 'thick clay.' So in ver. 7 'bite' may mean 'exact usury of.' cf. Jer. 8.17; Ezek. 22.12."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 2,
      "start_verse": 10,
      "end_chapter": 2,
      "end_verse": 10,
      "title": "",
      "content": "against (f-16) Or 'endangered.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 2,
      "start_verse": 13,
      "end_chapter": 2,
      "end_verse": 13,
      "title": "",
      "content": "nations (g-18) Leummim, Ps. 2.1. vain? (h-22) Or 'to no purpose.' see Jer. 51.58; Isa. 30.7."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 2,
      "start_verse": 15,
      "end_chapter": 2,
      "end_verse": 15,
      "title": "",
      "content": "flask, (i-14) Or 'thy poison,' 'thy fury.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 2,
      "start_verse": 16,
      "end_chapter": 2,
      "end_verse": 16,
      "title": "",
      "content": "of (k-7) Or 'more than with.' foreskin (l-15) Or 'thine uncircumcision.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 2,
      "start_verse": 17,
      "end_chapter": 2,
      "end_verse": 17,
      "title": "",
      "content": "afraid; (m-18) Or 'shall affright thee.' land, (a-30) Or 'earth.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 1,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 1,
      "title": "",
      "content": "Shigionoth. (b-8) Plural of Shiggaion. see title of Ps. 7."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 2,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 2,
      "title": "",
      "content": "work (c-14) Poal. as ch. 1.5."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 3,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 3,
      "title": "",
      "content": "full (d-22) Or 'was full.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 4,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 4,
      "title": "",
      "content": "Rays (e-8) Lit. 'horns.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 6,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 6,
      "title": "",
      "content": "earth; (f-6) Or 'made the earth to tremble.' everlasting. (g-27) Or 'His are the ways of old.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 14,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 14,
      "title": "",
      "content": "leaders. (h-13) Others read 'the leaders of his hordes.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 16,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 16,
      "title": "",
      "content": "invader (a-35) Or 'his overcomer.' people. (b-41) Or 'when he that rusheth in troops upon us shall come up against the people.' Cf. Gen. 49.19."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 19,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 19,
      "title": "",
      "content": "Lord, (c-3) Jehovah Adonai. see Ezek. 2.4."
